# Regenerate: build `counterspy`, put it on PATH, then `vhs docs/screenshots/scan.tape`
Output "/tmp/throwaway.gif"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1500
Set Height 620
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Dracula"
Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Type "counterspy scan"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 22s
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/scan.png"
